{
  "version": 1,
  "document": {
    "key": "omem:apps/server/src/review/model-config.ts",
    "title": "评审代码模型配置入口",
    "summary": "从项目级 JSON 显式装配代码理解模型；默认无模型，区分未配置与配置损坏，且本文件只确认传输枚举，不证明模型能力兼容性。",
    "category": "configuration",
    "sections": [
      {
        "key": "purpose",
        "title": "配置边界与默认行为",
        "body": "该模块为 repo-review 选择独立的模型配置：环境变量 `REVIEW_CODE_MODEL_CONFIG` 优先，否则在评审仓库根目录寻找 `config/review-code-model.json`；两者都没有时不启用模型。文件注释同时声明不读取个人 profile 或秘密，配置存在也只允许后续显式生成，不会在启动时自动推理。[[c1]]"
      },
      {
        "key": "flow",
        "title": "加载、校验与装配",
        "body": "加载器同步读取 UTF-8 JSON。缺少配置路径会返回 `transport: \"none\"`；但已指定文件不可读、JSON 无效或 transport 不属于 `none/acp/cli/http` 时，会抛出 `CodeModelUnavailableError`。通过枚举检查后，预算、命令、参数、model、effort、超时和 endpoint 等字段被原样整理。[[c2]]\n\n`buildReviewCodeModel` 再把该配置交给 `buildUnderstandingModelPort`，其返回值允许为空。此前“传输专属必填项均由下游检查”的宽泛结论已被替代：现有材料只能证明调用发生，不能确认 CLI 命令、HTTP endpoint、模型能力发现或 effort 兼容性如何校验。[[c3]]"
      }
    ],
    "citations": [
      {
        "key": "c1",
        "label": "评审模型配置边界",
        "reason": "支持项目配置查找顺序、缺省无模型、不读取个人配置以及启动不自动推理的论断。",
        "relation": "explains",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/src/review/model-config.ts",
          "startLine": 1,
          "endLine": 17
        },
        "quote": "/** Review uses the checked-in config/review-code-model.json as its actual\n * profile. REVIEW_CODE_MODEL_CONFIG explicitly overrides it; personal profiles\n * and secrets are never consulted. A missing project profile means no model.\n * Configuring a profile enables explicit generation, never inference on boot. */\nimpor"
      },
      {
        "key": "c2",
        "label": "配置读取与基础校验",
        "reason": "支持缺省返回、文件与 JSON 错误处理、transport 枚举检查及已知字段铺开的流程。",
        "relation": "implements",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/src/review/model-config.ts",
          "startLine": 20,
          "endLine": 62
        },
        "quote": "const NONE: UnderstandingTransportConfig = { transport: \"none\" };\n\n/** Load the explicit review model config. Defaults to no model; never throws on\n * missing config — only throws on an explicitly-broken file so the operator\n * notices a typo instead of silently running without a model. */\nexport function loadReviewCod"
      },
      {
        "key": "c3",
        "label": "模型端口构建入口",
        "reason": "仅证明加载后的配置被传入代码理解端口，并支持对下游校验能力保持审慎。",
        "relation": "calls",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/src/review/model-config.ts",
          "startLine": 65,
          "endLine": 70
        },
        "quote": "/** Build the port from the explicit config file (null = no model). */\nexport function buildReviewCodeModel(\n  path = reviewModelConfigPath(),\n): UnderstandingModelPort | null {\n  const config = loadReviewCodeModelConfig(path);\n  return buildUnderstandingModelPort(config);"
      }
    ],
